&_nc_oc=AdpOC2TzRknlISDKDEyUUXX-RIqhtEYjuvuALINxzyU1hfcgPpSov0M_0-KYUxWZOjE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAnPvgYbr1o9N6vkcLUUFGk0IswdDOIDYOrQ205Iw_PSg&oe=6A4A753E"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5JdumKcI88wQ7kNvwGvAazU&_nc_oc=Adqo5QdqaHfmhpm3pyrT3PwZcwSE7MfoIthReY_DPfRIaeMTdU2J6UbVkyx38HoIG_8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQC-OhkZHWBQqL_ujUC4jn3edIbgrp0EiXNtAaRAhxcNmw&oe=6A4A4DFC"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vQxgk1oOfhkQ7kNvwEuzUob&_nc_oc=Adp1DPsL17jZ84oQxRPmIPkWHwdlg8dYEeS7fUaqMPk8dayig5P1Q_SxPmGxXIZpwFk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAtBHM-lyvxdEWKcfjzTIhVN-dPoJNTaf3JU-NGoHziQA&oe=6A4A6C87"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YBmHZhnyvHgQ7kNvwGOOdQ3&_nc_oc=AdrkbXo_-2cM_qPw7qOf4c_edp4XcP5C62PZ7zbAy5lantkUTvluUYLIr86wOfzfXl0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBuCUbEHcSo1-xjqX9w4sfImQaazhO7LY2gGpbmMEv8qA&oe=6A4A5855"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=U9F5LNsKp6EQ7kNvwEsJr2N&_nc_oc=AdoTuFFe3W32i84M0QR_4ocyOdxAux7BumMAD8tl6uw3KCX59eE1tmA6TUud7LXnSFA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDPov9TS11S3ht5GhoUR3qpF4pMWervDAfMQ5hAikE3qA&oe=6A4A64E4"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.